                        "form": "пустыре́"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b5c262f6-1055-4d23-b4b1-615843e720bb",
                        "entry_id": "3f32ba1e-3153-301f-9e27-a1130ed6a440",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "пустыря́х"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a7d5966c-745c-3ae9-84f0-2e9f1c36d645",
                        "entry_id": "3f32ba1e-3153-301f-9e27-a1130ed6a440",
                        "glosses": [
                            "незастроенное, запущенное место (обычно близ жилья или на месте разрушенного жилья)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8eb6e518-d879-4568-a0a2-a4daaeef86bf",
                                "sense_id": "a7d5966c-745c-3ae9-84f0-2e9f1c36d645",
                                "text": "Но как ни безотрадны были в это время картины людных мест города, они не могли дать и самого слабого понятия о впечатлениях, производимых на свежего человека видами пустырей и бесконечных заборов, огораживающих болотистые улицы одного из печальнейших углов Петербургской стороны."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08dab7e0-ce3a-41cd-9ab6-dc976775b485",
                                "sense_id": "a7d5966c-745c-3ae9-84f0-2e9f1c36d645",
                                "text": "— А вы вон к тому краю, прямо по циркулю пройдите, там в заброшенном саду, пустырём прозывается, всегда зайцы находятся, — сказал хорунжий, тотчас изменяя свой язык."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6b74e14-269d-4a65-81f6-2a8893b7e14f",
                                "sense_id": "a7d5966c-745c-3ae9-84f0-2e9f1c36d645",
                                "text": "Церковь Успения божией матери находилась очень близко от дома невесты и стояла тогда на пустыре."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cdfefbfc-f475-4ebc-9333-792d00d16f11",
                        "source_entry_id": "3f32ba1e-3153-301f-9e27-a1130ed6a440",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7d5966c-745c-3ae9-84f0-2e9f1c36d645",
                        "target_lang_word": "wasteland",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wasteland",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c974b87e-3677-3b3a-8c9c-ea1b054931fa",
                                        "entry_id": "1fd04589-fd72-32ae-bc60-824c58481a0e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place with no remaining resources; a desert."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "648ab2fe-adbb-4f4b-bb66-3b71711ac666",
                                                "sense_id": "c974b87e-3677-3b3a-8c9c-ea1b054931fa",
                                                "text": "Ten years of drought had left the area a wasteland."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26685a8b-037e-492c-a2c0-9914dea2ab1c",
                                                "sense_id": "c974b87e-3677-3b3a-8c9c-ea1b054931fa",
                                                "text": "2007, Kai Hansen, \"To Mother Earth\", Gamma Ray, Land of the Free II.\nHere create another wasteland / On and on 'til nothing's there / Here it comes, the devastation / Poisoning the air"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c75c896a-14c4-3e8b-a123-5f2c239bdd87",
                                        "entry_id": "1fd04589-fd72-32ae-bc60-824c58481a0e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any barren or uninteresting place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e26382b4-6daa-4003-a7e1-9f9e697ade71",
                                                "sense_id": "c75c896a-14c4-3e8b-a123-5f2c239bdd87",
                                                "text": "After his experiences, he no longer found western Kansas such a wasteland."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49c6e18f-7324-49f8-a5b6-1b288fba0a39",
                                                "sense_id": "c75c896a-14c4-3e8b-a123-5f2c239bdd87",
                                                "text": "Keep your eyes glued to that set until the station signs off. I can assure you that what you will observe is a vast wasteland."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2553c14-b438-36ee-9ab8-a25ab52e7bb0",
                                        "entry_id": "1fd04589-fd72-32ae-bc60-824c58481a0e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A devastated, uninhabitable area."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32acc842-26db-424b-8c71-b96e961a6ad2",
                                                "sense_id": "d2553c14-b438-36ee-9ab8-a25ab52e7bb0",
                                                "text": "Another place where, from the aesthetic point of view, a long tunnel would have been a real blessing, is East London as viewed from the carriage window on the old Great Eastern line. Despite a vast change from crowded slums to tracts of wasteland, due to its grim wartime experience, this approach still provides a shabby and unworthy introduction to the great capital."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "911a42dd-5855-4786-8859-e46f0bf2cf90",
                                                "sense_id": "d2553c14-b438-36ee-9ab8-a25ab52e7bb0",
                                                "text": "How many nuclear missiles would have to be launched at the United States to turn it into a complete wasteland?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9ef9602-315b-4ea5-b158-892b72373128",
                                                "sense_id": "d2553c14-b438-36ee-9ab8-a25ab52e7bb0",
                                                "text": "Yet had the whole train and all its bombs gone, had the engine crew merely jumped from the train and run as simple self-preservation would have suggested, or unhitched just the engine to make their escape faster, the whole town would have gone and most of the people with it, leaving just a smoking wasteland. Hundreds would have died."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3549360-e766-36f8-be3c-16c750092159",
                                        "entry_id": "1fd04589-fd72-32ae-bc60-824c58481a0e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unused land."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e89113d-5cb5-4d2e-b575-bac93b0a12e3",
                                                "sense_id": "e3549360-e766-36f8-be3c-16c750092159",
                                                "text": "Azaz and Ray were nominated individually for what, at first glance, looked like a project to transform wasteland at South Tottenham station into a community garden."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b59dcd69-e11e-40b1-ae63-ca935cc699ec",
                        "source_entry_id": "3f32ba1e-3153-301f-9e27-a1130ed6a440",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7d5966c-745c-3ae9-84f0-2e9f1c36d645",
                        "target_lang_word": "pustkowie",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pustkowie",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "517ab5b3-d7de-3314-88a4-613a20b7eabc",
                                        "entry_id": "560fc533-b40f-3991-8da8-104ce9eb9629",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "miejsce lub obszar niezamieszkany przez ludzi, puste"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0a9ed32-ad22-4bb3-9678-233268a3217e",
                                                "sense_id": "517ab5b3-d7de-3314-88a4-613a20b7eabc",
                                                "text": "Niech ich mieszkanie stanie się pustkowiem, / a w ich namiotach niech braknie mieszkańców!"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e17476b-fea2-434e-bdcc-a33c0c7c2798",
                        "source_entry_id": "3f32ba1e-3153-301f-9e27-a1130ed6a440",
                        "source_sense_id": "a7d5966c-745c-3ae9-84f0-2e9f1c36d645",
                        "target_lang_word": "terrain vague",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "terrain vague",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c1675ac-50fe-3930-9fbe-fdfb9ce1f19e",
                                        "entry_id": "10ee62b8-8e05-387b-a161-d8d3ad0e4ec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Terrain qui, dans une ville, n’est ni construit, ni cultivé, ni occupé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Urbanisme"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8e741d5-e5ff-4946-a2dd-c6c2b3df04b0",
                                                "sense_id": "6c1675ac-50fe-3930-9fbe-fdfb9ce1f19e",
                                                "text": "Au milieu du terrain vague et aride qui touche d'un côté à la muraille grise de la ville et à la Porte de Lambèse, et de l'autre aux premières pentes de la montagne, la mosquée s'élevait solitaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0552b3aa-ed7d-4da7-b58e-219f5f7770fb",
                                                "sense_id": "6c1675ac-50fe-3930-9fbe-fdfb9ce1f19e",
                                                "text": "À quatre mètres de hauteur sur le second siège, une dame a jeté les yeux dans un entresol sans défiance, paisiblement ouvert en face d'un terrain vague, et elle t'a vue ma chère."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "220626bb-f30b-4c50-8fcc-57ada8f3856e",
                                                "sense_id": "6c1675ac-50fe-3930-9fbe-fdfb9ce1f19e",
                                                "text": "Dans les vergers ou les terrains vagues, où l'on ne compte pas sur la récolte du sol, on plante en général 200 pommiers ou poiriers par hectare."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6662a557-9f45-4c8d-ac8e-9ac022aacc3e",
                                                "sense_id": "6c1675ac-50fe-3930-9fbe-fdfb9ce1f19e",
                                                "text": "Un terrain vague est donc un lieu vide de cultures et de constructions dans un espace urbanisé."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdd617b2-e412-3695-a94a-ece6a4f3abf7",
                                        "entry_id": "10ee62b8-8e05-387b-a161-d8d3ad0e4ec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Définition manquante ou à compléter. (Ajouter)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68692f34-4edb-494d-8096-cc1d986f17d6",
                                                "sense_id": "fdd617b2-e412-3695-a94a-ece6a4f3abf7",
                                                "text": "« L’équivalence agronomique d’une femme n’est pas codifiée avec précision. Il y a tant de créatures dont le cœur est un terrain vague et dont le giron exigerait d’être bien phosphaté. En ce qui vous concerne, la Beauce et tous ses blés, le Bordelais et tous ses vignobles ne paieraient pas assez la saveur de vos baisers. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
